a2_dense_correspondence,A2 — 稠密对应: 光流、立体匹配与图像配准 (Dense Correspondence: Flow & Registration),dense correspondence field learning registration mathematical 2024 2025 NeurIPS,10,NeurIPS Poster FLOWING: Implicit Neural Flows for Structure-Preserving Morphing,https://neurips.cc/virtual/2025/poster/116569,neurips.cc,0.47657967,"and temporal coherence by encoding structural flow prop- erties directly into the network architectures. This flow-centric approach yields principled and stable transformations, enabling accurate and structure-preserving morphing of both 2D images and 3D shapes. Extensive experiments across a range of applications—including face and image morphing, as well as Gaussian Splatting morphing—show that FLOWING achieves state-of-the-art morphing quality with faster convergence. Code and pretrained models are available in [...] Skip to yearly menu bar

