a3_deep_matching,A3 — 深度匹配: 端到端对应学习 (Deep Feature Matching & End-to-End Correspondence),end-to-end correspondence prediction deep learning mathematical 2024 2025,4,The End of Manual Decoding: Towards Truly End-to-End Language Models,https://arxiv.org/html/2510.26697v1,arxiv.org,0.26014078,"R1-Distill-Qwen-7B333 et al., 2025): A distilled model from the Qwen family developed by DeepSeek, known for its strong reasoning capabilities.

Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507444 2025): An advanced MoE architecture instruct model from Qwen3.

