Maojiang Su ⋅ Jerry Yao-Chieh Hu ⋅ Yi-Chen Lee ⋅ Ning Zhu ⋅ Jui-Hui Chung ⋅ Shang Wu ⋅ Zhao Song ⋅ Minshuo Chen ⋅ Han Liu

