 and natural language processing capabilities, LLMs have been widely discussed and employed as educational assistants (Kasneci et al., 2023; Wang et al., 2024; Jeon and Lee, 2023; Yan et al., 2024). Applications of LLMs in education span various subjects and levels, from K-12 to higher education (Wu et al., 2024; Yigci et al., 2025). For instance, Dan et al. (2023) developed an LLM-based chatbot system to support personalized education. The system offers functions such as question-answering and essay assessment, while also incorporating Socratic teaching methods and emotional support. Song et al. (2024) leveraged open-source LLMs to achieve automated essay scoring and revision. Using a dataset of 600 human-scored",True
a1_keypoint_matching,A1 — 稀疏对应: 关键点匹配与特征对齐 (Sparse Correspondence: Keypoint Matching),RANSAC robust estimation convergence geometric matching 2024 2025 theory,6,Abstract - arXiv,https://arxiv.org/html/2604.14025v1,arxiv.org,0.1028533,"Beyond feature-level alignment, a geometry-first line of work establishes a stronger foundation by directly regressing 3D coordinates and camera geometry. DUSt3R  establishes a new foundation for geometric 3D vision by reformulating pairwise and multi-view stereo as a direct, dense coordinate regression problem. The model simultaneously predicts dense pointmaps and relative camera poses from unposed image pairs.
MASt3R  augments DUSt3R with a dense local feature head and a novel matching loss, enabling robust and accurate matching capabilities. By introducing a fast reciprocal matching scheme, MASt3R achieves both theoretical efficiency and nature performance. [...] Follow-up works substantially improve the quality and robustness across challenging scenarios. For example, Mip-NeRF  and Mip-NeRF 360  address aliasing artifacts and extend NeRF’s reach to unbounded scenes through multi-scale representations and advanced regularization. Ref-NeRF  adapts the volumetric formulation to better capture reflective surfaces. DS-NeRF  and NerfingMVS  incorporate geometric priors to accelerate convergence and improve scene accuracy, even with sparser supervision. On the efficiency front, InstantNGP  leverages hash-based encodings to dramatically speed up training and inference. [...] Beyond dense cost-volume construction, another line of work turns to correspondence-based geometric reasoning. SRF  introduces a neural stereo framework. By establishing stereo correspondence between image pairs to learn and infer the attributes of 3D points, the need for complete construction of cost volume is avoided. This method provides robust geometric signals by modeling the similarity between paired features, enabling the model to maintain strong generalization ability even in sparse perspectives or large baseline configurations. Adopting the corresponding relation localization strategy, GPNR  uses epipolar geometry from the reference perspective to extract local patches along the epipolar lines. Subsequently, the information of these geometrically constrained patches is aggregated",True
