a3_deep_matching,A3 — 深度匹配: 端到端对应学习 (Deep Feature Matching & End-to-End Correspondence),end-to-end correspondence prediction deep learning mathematical 2024 2025,10,TDATR: Improving End-to-End Table Recognition via Table Detail-Aware Learning and Cell-Level Visual Alignment,https://arxiv.org/html/2603.22819v1,arxiv.org,0.04773132,"Recent studies [48, 68, 10] attempt to unify TSR and TCR into a single vision–language model that directly generates structured outputs.
